We guessed Nightmist would win because we assumed she had to learn something to discover what she needed to do to deal with OblivAeon. We thought she&#39;s learn it from Jansa, though, but it worked out.&nbsp;

We really couldn&#39;t imagine Unity taking out Omnitron-U, so that was a shock. We also couldn&#39;t imagine Haka reaching Ra, as others described (and we saw a Ra vs. Fanatic confrontation as an interesting one), or that Stuntman could take that level of abuse.&nbsp; :open_mouth: 

<span style="font-size: 13px;">On the flip side, we didn&#39;t realize Chrono-Ranger could bounce around like that! We also forgot we were dealing with Dark Visionary, which makes a big difference. And we assumed Plague Rat&#39;s venom would work against Fright Train -- turns out it was too slow to do what we expected it to do.&nbsp;</span>

<span style="font-size: 13px;">But none of that do I blame on anyone but us in our analysis.&nbsp; :slightly_smiling_face: &nbsp;It was all good fun!&nbsp; :grin: </span>

